She's got you here. She's kept Chris busy to leave you with time on your hands.

00:57:24.110 --> 00:57:25.430
You're a marked man, Larry.

00:57:32.780 --> 00:57:43.880
study windows. I did. I like to know when people come in. I'm sorry I raised my voice, Larry. With Janet,

00:57:43.920 --> 00:57:51.250
everything has to be smooth, soft, green, like poison ivy. You've obviously been drinking again. I've

00:57:51.250 --> 00:57:59.740
been telling our young friend about women. Larry, I'm sorry. Hark at that soft tone, soft and caressing

00:57:59.740 --> 00:57:59.940
is

00:58:00.460 --> 00:58:04.860
As soon as we get anywhere near the truth, they turn soft on us. That's their trick.

