00:58:30.190 --> 00:58:33.990
I shall go. I don't know quite where.

00:58:35.240 --> 00:58:37.260
Maybe down to the village to amuse myself.

00:58:38.590 --> 00:58:39.690
Maybe over the moor.

00:58:41.550 --> 00:58:45.640
Yeah. Yes, that's an idea that might amuse me very much.

00:58:47.270 --> 00:58:49.150
I think I'll take your horse for a gallop.

00:58:51.830 --> 00:58:56.000
Don't you go near Fury. He's mine. Don't touch him.

00:58:58.520 --> 00:58:59.020
I'll stop him.

00:59:01.820 --> 00:59:05.610
No, Larry, let him go. He'll be trampled if he tries to mount.

00:59:05.980 --> 00:59:07.380
