01:01:18.290 --> 01:01:18.930
No, I'm not.

01:01:20.000 --> 01:01:21.000
You see, I'm in love.

01:01:21.840 --> 01:01:25.240
And when you're really in love, you can't be a good loser.

01:01:32.650 --> 01:01:34.150
How about a cup of tea, Larry?

01:01:34.540 --> 01:01:34.980
