01:03:29.090 --> 01:03:29.370
Fury.

01:03:30.380 --> 01:03:32.500
He stumbled in a rabbit hole and I fell off.

01:03:34.110 --> 01:03:35.790
I expected him to get up, but he didn't.

01:03:37.920 --> 01:03:38.740
He was in pain.

01:03:40.030 --> 01:03:42.960
There was blood in his mouth, so I shot him.

01:03:50.460 --> 01:03:51.400
I had to do it.

01:03:53.960 --> 01:03:54.960
There's nothing you can do.

01:03:56.320 --> 01:03:58.310
Larry, Larry, get Henderson, quickly.

01:03:58.490 --> 01:03:59.890
Henderson's coming. I've already sent for him.

01:04:00.960 --> 01:04:03.210
You killed fury!

01:04:05.450 --> 01:04:07.710
Horse meant more to me than anyone on earth.

01:04:10.600 --> 01:04:12.020
I used to talk to him.

01:04:18.370 --> 01:04:19.130
Human being.

01:04:22.380 --> 01:04:26.590
A man can see dead at my feet now.

01:04:28.280 --> 01:04:29.400
I could bring him back to life.

01:04:31.470 --> 01:04:32.410
And you killed him!

01:04:33.120 --> 01:04:34.920
I shot him because it was necessary.

01:05:04.830 --> 01:05:05.390
Drink this.

01:05:12.630 --> 01:05:21.240
I know.

01:05:22.120 --> 01:05:23.100
I've just come from there.

01:05:23.280 --> 01:05:24.800
It was all over very quickly.

