01:16:35.640 --> 01:16:37.580
There's an old wedding photo on top at Bureau.

01:16:38.760 --> 01:16:40.640
Do you think I could glance at it just out of curiosity?

01:16:41.400 --> 01:16:42.860
That's more than me jobs work.

01:16:42.900 --> 01:16:44.520
Oh, come, Mrs Bunting, just a peek.

